# The signing subkey of unitystack-package-signing.asc whose secret CI holds
# (LINUX_GPG_PRIVATE_KEY). The jobs that sign fail if the secret is another
# subkey (the spare's secret stays offline), and the checks of the public key
# name it as CI's. Change it in the same commit as the key when CI moves to
# the spare (build/linux/README.md, "If the CI secret leaks").
